t5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":3889,"givento":"Jurassic Pack","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":3914,"givento":"360 UT MILAN","cat1":1,"cat2":1,"cat3":2,"cat4":1,"cat5":1,"total":6,"comments":"There were occasions of unsportsmanlike conduct like shirt pulling, kicking a disc when we tried to pick it up after a turnover and a player insulting one of ours which lead us to call a spirit timeout.The spirit timeout helped to calm things down.\r\nOur players tried to communicate issues inside their matchups, we didn't feel like this, especially in the marking space, improved and in some cases worsened towards the end of the game.\r\nNevertheless there were also positive interactions on the pitch!"},{"game_id":3894,"givento":"Heidees","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":3897,"givento":"BFD La Fotta","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":10,"comments":null},{"game_id":3902,"givento":"Quijotes","cat1":0,"cat2":2,"cat3":1,"cat4":2,"cat5":1,"total":6,"comments":"Various situations where the rules were not applied correctly.\r\nWe perceived mocking behaviour and calls made purely in retaliation (even telling us this is the intention)\r\nWe feel our perspective was never valued and all calls contested.\r\nDemanding the disc back after a turn should stand by rule 16.3, bystanders of a different team support this stance."}],"spiritreceived":[{"game_id":3888,"givenby":"Bad Skid","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":3,"cat4":2,"cat5":2,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":3889,"givenby":"Jurassic Pack","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":1,"total":9,"comments":null},{"game_id":3914,"givenby":"360 UT MILAN","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":1,"cat5":1,"total":8,"comments":"The match was very enjoyable in terms of gameplay and intensity, but we note that certain behaviors seemed aimed from the very beginning at increasing the level of tension. Some calls appeared to have low relevance to the game and highlighted aspects that did not significantly affect play, at least from our point of view. Furthermore, the repeated attempts to initiate discussions along the sidelines following tries seemed unnecessary and contributed to the escalation of tension."},{"game_id":3894,"givenby":"Heidees","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":3897,"givenby":"BFD La Fotta","cat1":2,"cat2":2,"cat3":2,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":11,"comments":null},{"game_id":3902,"givenby":"Quijotes","cat1":1,"cat2":2,"cat3":1,"cat4":2,"cat5":3,"total":9,"comments":null}],"spiritstats":{"games":6},"spirittotal":{"total":59}}